#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:5
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "端子"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:7
msgid ""
"A terminal is a part from the `element`_ that will allow a connection with "
"one `conductor`_ during the schema creation."
msgstr "端子是 `元件 <element_>`_ 的一个部件，在创建原理图时用于与一个 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 连接。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:11
msgid "Create terminal"
msgstr "创建端子"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:13
msgid "The terminal can only be added to `workspace`_ from `toolbar`_."
msgstr "端子只能从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 添加到 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:15
msgid "Select the icon |icon_terminal| from `toolbar`_ to add a terminal."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |icon_terminal| 以添加端子。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:18
msgid "icon_terminal"
msgstr "端子图标"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:16
msgid ""
"Click on the initial point from the terminal in the `workspace`_ to add the "
"terminal."
msgstr "在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中单击端子的起始点以添加端子。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:23
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Parts**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **Settings > Display > Parts** 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:26
msgid "Terminal properties"
msgstr "端子属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:28
msgid ""
"Element part properties can be displayed from `information panel`_ when the "
"part is selected."
msgstr "选中部件后，可以从 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 显示元件部件属性。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:33
msgid ""
"If the `information panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Information**."
msgstr ""
"如果 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **Settings > Display > Information**"
" 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:38
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech terminal part from element"
msgstr "图：元件中的 QElectroTech 端子部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:40
msgid "QElectroTech allows customizing different terminal properties:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许自定义不同的端子属性："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst
msgid "Position"
msgstr "位置"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:44
msgid "The start point coordinates (x, y) can be defined."
msgstr "可以定义起始点的坐标 (x, y)。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst
msgid "Orientation"
msgstr "方向"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:48
msgid ""
"The exit direction from the connector can be defined. The four possible "
"orientations are *North*, *East*, *South* and *West*."
msgstr "可以定义连接器的引出方向。四个可能的方向为 *北*、*东*、*南* 和 *西* 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/terminal.rst:52
msgid "Terminal uuid."
msgstr "端子 UUID。"
